20change.%0A-%20Twenty-four%20complete%20seeded%20dataset%20digests%20cover%20several%20address%20widths%2C%20seeds%2C%20shuffle%20modes%2C%20class-ratio%20endpoints%2C%20and%20rounding%20cases.%20Separate%20assertions%20check%20the%20selected-register%20label%20relationship%2C%20item%2Flabel%20dtypes%2C%20output%20ordering%2C%20and%20preservation%20of%20the%20global%20RNG%20state.%0A-%20New%20and%20existing%20multiplexer%20tests%3A%20**31%20passed**.%20Complete%20repository%20suite%3A%20**765%20passed%2C%203%20skipped**.%0A-%20Baseline%20and%20patch%20ran%20in%20the%20same%20Python%203.11.18%20job%20with%20the%20unchanged%20frozen%20lock.%0A-%20Complete%20repository%20isort%2FBlack%2C%20changed-file%20Flake8%2C%20%60git%20diff%20--check%60%2C%20package%20build%2C%20and%20strict%20Twine%20checks%20passed.%20The%20repository-wide%20Flake8%20report%20retains%20existing%20findings%20and%20is%20not%20presented%20as%20a%20clean%20lint%20gate.%0A%0A%5BBaseline%2C%20complete%20validation%2C%20and%20benchmark%20evidence%5D(https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FAfloat16%2Fgeoopt%2Factions%2Fruns%2F43891867287%2Fjob%2F133384927985).%0A%0A%23%23%23%20Pull%20Request%20Checklist%0A%0A-%20%5Bx%5D%20Added%20a%20changelog%20entry.%0A-%20%5Bx%5D%20Added%20regression%20fixtures%20and%20tests%20in%20the%20corresponding%20test%20directory.%0A-%20%5Bx%5D%20Preserved%20the%20public%20interface%20and%20seeded%20behavior.%0A-%20%5Bx%5D%20Ran%20focused%20and%20full%20repository%20tests.%0A-%20%5Bx%5D%20Checked%20formatting%20and%20style%20with%20the%20scope%20described%20above.%0A",
