%20%7C%0A%7C%20Iris%20corrected%20%7C%200.470%20ms%20%7C%200.170%20ms%20%7C%0A%7C%20Boston%20Housing%20%7C%202.948%20ms%20%7C%201.454%20ms%20%7C%0A%7C%20Three%20Blobs%20%7C%200.514%20ms%20%7C%200.256%20ms%20%7C%0A%0AMNIST%20is%20**7.6x%20faster**%20in%20this%20benchmark.%20In%20separate%20allocation%20measurements%2C%20its%20peak%20drops%20from%20**228%2C558%2C237%20to%2035%2C068%2C071%20bytes%20(84.7%25)**.%20Each%20dataset's%20complete%20feature%2Flabel%20output%20digest%20is%20identical%20on%20base%20and%20patch.%20Timings%20describe%20this%20workload%3B%20the%20fallback%20deliberately%20retains%20the%20original%20parser's%20behavior%20and%20cost.%0A%0A%23%23%23%20Validation%0A%0A-%20Exact%20upstream%20base%3A%20%601aee767ef57b84a8191511a08955c583b65de382%60.%0A-%20**1%20of%2041%20new%20cases%20fails%20on%20unchanged%20source**%3A%20the%20MNIST%20peak-allocation%20bound.%20All%2041%20pass%20after%20the%20change.%0A-%20Tests%20compare%20every%20bundled%20value%20with%20the%20original%20parser%20and%20cover%20blank%20fields%2C%20nonnumeric%20fields%2C%20NaN%2Finfinite%20numeric%20fields%2C%20empty%20files%2C%20dtypes%2C%20Iris%20versions%2C%20and%20independence%20between%20calls.%0A-%20Relevant%20data%20tests%3A%20**56%20passed**.%20Complete%20repository%20suite%3A%20**781%20passed%2C%203%20skipped**.%0A-%20Complete%20repository%20isort%2FBlack%2C%20changed-file%20Flake8%2C%20%60git%20diff%20--check%60%2C%20package%20build%2C%20and%20strict%20Twine%20checks%20passed.%20The%20repository-wide%20Flake8%20report%20retains%20existing%20findings%20and%20is%20not%20presented%20as%20a%20clean%20lint%20gate.%0A%0A%5BBaseline%2C%20complete%20validation%2C%20and%20benchmark%20evidence%5D(https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FAfloat16%2Fgeoopt%2Factions%2Fruns%2F43893510097%2Fjob%2F133390720852).%0A%0A%23%23%23%20Pull%20Request%20Checklist%0A%0A-%20%5Bx%5D%20Added%20a%20changelog%20entry.%0A-%20%5Bx%5D%20Added%20value%2C%20compatibility%2C%20and%20memory-regression%20tests.%0A-%20%5Bx%5D%20Preserved%20the%20public%20loader%20interfaces.%0A-%20%5Bx%5D%20Ran%20focused%20and%20full%20repository%20tests.%0A-%20%5Bx%5D%20Checked%20formatting%20and%20style%20with%20the%20scope%20described%20above.%0A",
